<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI says Q3 net at 913.7 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>BPI says Q3 net at 913.7 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of the Philippine Islands (BPI) said on Thursday its net earnings reached 913.741 million pesos from July to September this year.  </p>
<p>BPI's net earnings in the comparative July to September 1995 period reached 600.486 million pesos.</p>
<p>Revenues of the bank in the third quarter this year jumped by 28.7 percent to 4.52 billion pesos from the year-ago 3.512 billion pesos.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
